          "label": "9:00"
        }
      ],
      "highlight": "leo",
      "caption": "Leo, 12, gets his flu shot. It can't give him the flu: inside are only **harmless pieces** of the virus.",
      "notes": "Injected flu vaccines contain inactivated virus pieces or a single virus protein, never a live virus that can cause flu."
    },
